        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "It looks like the day came after all. There's no chance I'll make it through this one."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "Don't go out there, Talulah! Hide behind the shed... they won't look there! We'll tell them you were scared of what was coming and ran away! No one'd blame you for it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "But they might hurt you for it. I owe you better than that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I've left you some gold coins... from Victoria. Spend them sparingly, and they'll have you warm and well fed for the rest of your lives."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "Talulah, Talulah! Where are you going? My Talulah... you can't, you can't go to them! Those black-hearted patrolling bugs eat people alive!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "And I can't just stand by and let them torture the men and women of this village. I have to see this through. I'll lure them away, give them a wake-up call, let them know what they've wrought."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I know what's right. I'm not letting them punish these people. I'm not letting them murder anyone else."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I still remember how the boy next door was beaten to death for chucking a stone. I'll never forget."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_093#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "Talulah... Talulah! You can't... that's enough!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$doorknockquite",
            "volume": 0.9
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "Who?! Who's at the door...!? Is it the patrolmen?! Go away!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Ma'am, it's me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "Alina! Come in, come in!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$doorclosequite",
            "volume": 0.9
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "What's wrong? What's happened? Is there news?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "...Someone told."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_093#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "What? Told what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_093#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "The Patrol Unit knows there's an Infected in our village."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_093#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_079#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman",
        "text": "How could... this can't be... ahh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "I don't know who it was, but we all know what happens to those who harbor Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "Ma'am, my father passed early, and you took such good care of my mother, you and your husband both. You're like grandparents to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alina",
        "text": "And at this point, I can't really hide anything..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "\u2014Wait."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Miss, where did the Mister go?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
